      "id": "clm_01M4VEBZB45NH37WB43MMC4QNP",
      "statement": "The itemised figures of the return list fall short of its stated total of 42,360 in all three versions: 29,818 (Ezra 2), 31,089 (Nehemiah 7), 30,143 (1 Esdras 5).",
      "layer": "text",
      "passage": "Ezra.2.64",
      "classification": "strongly_supported",
      "reasoning": "The Ezra and Nehemiah sums were recomputed for this unit from the WEB text (42 and 40 items: 29,818 and 31,089). Keil tabulates all three totals and Kidner (via Guzik) gives the same figures. The 1 Esdras sum was not recomputed because the WEB notes give variant readings for several items. Josephus gives a different total again: 42,462.",
